@startuml 02b_state_organize_task
!include _style.iuml
title RishFlow – State Machine: File Organization Task

[*] --> Idle
Idle : entry / last_operations = []

Idle --> Validating : start_organizing(source, dest, mode)
Validating : do / check source exists, create dest if needed

Validating --> Failed : [source missing OR\ncannot create dest]
Validating --> Organizing : [paths valid] / spawn background thread,\nlog "Started organizing"

state Organizing {
  [*] --> ReadingNextFile
  ReadingNextFile --> Classifying : [file found] (skip directories)
  ReadingNextFile --> [*] : [no more files]

  Classifying : do / decide folder by sort mode\n(Extension | Date | Size | Name | AI)
  Classifying --> Moving : folder decided
  Classifying --> Moving : [AI error] / fallback by extension

  Moving : do / makedirs + shutil.move
  Moving --> Recording : [move ok] / files_moved++
  Moving --> ReadingNextFile : [move failed] / files_skipped++, log error

  Recording : do / append op, persist last_ops.json,\nlog activity
  Recording --> ReadingNextFile
}

Organizing --> Completed : all files processed /\nlog summary, notify UI (onOrganizeComplete)
Organizing --> Failed : unexpected exception / log error

Completed --> Reverting : revert_last()
Completed --> Idle : start new task

Reverting : do / move files back (reverse order),\nremove empty folders
Reverting --> Reverted : ops undone / clear last_ops.json
Reverted --> Idle

Failed --> Idle : user retries
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
